# Copy to .env and paste your key. .env is gitignored — it never leaves this machine.
#
# Powers two things: "Ask this document" in the nav bar, and slide 5's solutions table.
# Without a key both still work — passage search and a curated library — just not live.
#
# Set ONE of these. First one found wins: Gemini, then OpenAI, then Anthropic.

GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to gemini-2.5-flash. Run `npm run models` to see what your key has.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.5

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# Admin panel for the budget at /admin, and the team view at /team. Both write to the
# shared board, so both are gated. On a managed host, unset means those routes answer
# 404 — unavailable rather than open. Locally, unset leaves them open on your own
# machine. Never commit a real value here.

ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# Durable budget storage. Without these, the budget lives in a file that free hosts
# wipe on every redeploy. With them, state is mirrored to a secret GitHub gist.
#   gh gist create budget-state.json --desc "budget state"
# then take the id from the URL.
GIST_ID=
GITHUB_TOKEN=
